    <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:2em;">In-Person Sessions</h2>
            <p class="reveal">I travel frequently to give lectures and to collaborate on projects such as Qigong, Yoga, Therapeutic Bodywork and Meditation retreats, so my regular teaching takes place online. In-person classes and one-to-one sessions may occasionally be available at selected locations along the way. Please get in touch if you would like to hear about them.</p>

